  "Bizning manzil Boyovut tumani Jo'langar mahallasi Ma'rifat ko'chasi 19-uyda joylashgan. Bizning maktab 1978-yil qurilgan. 2021-yilda kapital rekonstruktsiya qilindi. O'quvchi o'rni (quvvati) 746 o'rinli. Hozirgi kunda o'quvchilarimiz soni 736 nafarni tashkil etmoqda. Pedagog hodimlar soni 56 nafar. Oliy toifali 4 nafar, I-toifali 13 nafar, II-toifali 21 nafar, Mutaxassislar 18 nafarni tashkil etmoqda. 11-sinf bitiruvchilarimiz soni 73 nafar bo'lib ulardan OTM ga kirganlar 32 nafar (43,8%) tashkil qiladi.": "Our address: Jo'langar neighborhood, Ma'rifat street 19, Boyovut District, Syrdarya Region. The school was built in 1978 and fully renovated in 2021. Capacity: 746 students; 736 are currently enrolled. There are 56 teachers: 4 of the highest category, 13 first category, 21 second category and 18 specialists. Of 73 grade-11 graduates, 32 (43.8%) entered higher education institutions.",
  "Informatika xonasi 15 o'rinli. Xona kompyuter bilan ta'minlangan, barchasi internet tarmog'iga ulangan. Xonada elektron doska ham mavjud. Matematika xonasi 30 o'rinli. Xona stol va stul bilan ta'minlangan bo'lib doska, 2 ta shkaf ham mavjud. Xonalarning holati a'lo darajada o'quvchilar uchun sharoitlar qilingan!": "The Computer Science room seats 15 students and is equipped with computers, all connected to the internet. It also has an electronic board. The Mathematics room seats 30 and is furnished with desks, chairs, a board and 2 cabinets. The rooms are in excellent condition, with every condition created for students!",
  "Ona tili va Adabiyot xonasi 30 o'rinli. Xona stol va stul bilan ta'minlangan bo'lib doska, 2 ta shkaf ham mavjud. Xonalarda ko'rgazmali qurollar ham mavjud. Xonalarning holati a'lo darajada o'quvchilar uchun sharoitlar qilingan!": "The Uzbek Language and Literature room seats 30 students. It is furnished with desks, chairs, a board and 2 cabinets, and has visual teaching aids. The room is in excellent condition, with every condition created for students!",
  "Kimyo va Biologiya xonasi 30 o'rinli. Xona stol va stul bilan ta'minlangan bo'lib doska, 2 ta shkaf ham mavjud. Xonalarda ko'rgazmali qurollar ham mavjud. Labaratoriya xonalari ham mavjud va ular jihozlangan. Xonalarning holati a'lo darajada o'quvchilar uchun sharoitlar qilingan!": "The Chemistry and Biology room seats 30 students. It is furnished with desks, chairs, a board and 2 cabinets, and has visual teaching aids. Equipped laboratory rooms are also available. The rooms are in excellent condition, with every condition created for students!",
  "Fizika va Texnologiya xonasi 30 o'rinli. Xona stol va stul bilan ta'minlangan bo'lib doska, 2 ta shkaf ham mavjud. Xonalarda ko'rgazmali qurollar ham mavjud. Labaratoriya xonalari ham mavjud va ular jihozlangan. Xonalarning holati a'lo darajada o'quvchilar uchun sharoitlar qilingan!": "The Physics and Technology room seats 30 students. It is furnished with desks, chairs, a board and 2 cabinets, and has visual teaching aids. Equipped laboratory rooms are also available. The rooms are in excellent condition, with every condition created for students!",
  "<span>Boyovut_2-Maktab</span> <strong>2-Maktab-</strong>Sifatli bilim va yuqori natijalarga <br> bizning maktab bilan erishasiz <br>": "<span>Boyovut_2-Maktab</span> <strong>2-Maktab-</strong>Quality education and high results <br> you will achieve with our school <br>",
  "Informatika fani bo'yicha tumanda hamda viloyatda I-o'rinni egallagan.Yosh dasturchi-2020 ko'rik tanlovida tumanda hamda viloyatda Mobil ilova yo'nalishi bo'yicha I-o'rinni egallagan.": "Took 1st place in Informatics at the district and regional level. In the 'Young Programmer-2020' competition, took 1st place in mobile applications at the district and regional level.",
  "Karantin sababli darslarni maktabimiz pedagoglari onlayn dars o'tmoqdalar. Kundalik.com orqali Zoom platformasi yordamida o'quvchilarga dars o'tib baholashmoqda.": "Due to the quarantine, our teachers are conducting lessons online. They teach and assess students via Kundalik.com and the Zoom platform.",
